% expect-output: /invalidrestore
% Scenario: a local composite created after save and still on the operand
% stack makes restore fail.
% Expect: prints "/invalidrestore".
save
[1 2]                     % created after the save, left on the stack
1 index                   % the save object
{ restore } stopped pop
$error /errorname get ==  % /invalidrestore
